OL,3,ARoyal Mail misses delivery targets
OL,4,Aagain but hails 'encouraging' signs
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Mail has once again missed its
OL,7,Fdelivery targets for first and second
OL,8,Fclass post, but said it is making
OL,9,Fprogress towards the goals as its
OL,10,Fturnaround plan continues.
OL,12,FThe postal service delivered 85% of
OL,13,Ffirst class deliveries the next day
OL,14,Fbetween March and June, up from 76% in
OL,15,Fthe same three months of 2025, but
OL,16,Fbelow regulator Ofcom's 90% target.
OL,18,FSecond class mail was delivered within
OL,19,Fthree days 91% of the time, another
OL,20,Fimprovement from the previous year, but
OL,21,Fshort of Ofcom's 95% target.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
