OL,3,ARoyal Mail misses delivery targets
OL,4,Aagain but hails 'encouraging' signs
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Mail said the results are
OL,7,F"encouraging and show that the work we
OL,8,Fare doing to improve the service is
OL,9,Fhaving an impact".
